      {
        "id": "about",
        "slug": "about",
        "status": "draft",
        "data": {
          "title": "A little about me.",
          "intro": "I’m Andy Eskridge, Director of Software Development at ISN, based in Dallas, TX.",
          "role": "Director of Software Development at ISN",
          "location": "Dallas, TX",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "bio",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "bios",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "I’m interested in the people and decisions behind good software, as well as the work of building it. This site brings those interests together: engineering leadership, hands-on technical experiments, and occasional notes from life."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "lab",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "labs",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Outside my professional work, my TrueNAS and HexOS homelab gives me room to experiment with infrastructure, automation, and the practical details of operating software."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "purpose",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "purposes",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "I’m starting this space with a fresh perspective and making room for writing that is useful, thoughtful, and grounded in real experience."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "contact_links": []
        }
      }
    ],
    "posts": [
      {
        "id": "intro",
        "slug": "a-place-to-think-and-build",
        "status": "draft",
        "data": {
          "title": "A place to think and build",
          "excerpt": "Starting again with room for engineering leadership, technical experiments, and the things that connect them.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "intro",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "intros",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "I wanted a place that felt like my own: somewhere to write about leading software teams, share the things I build, and work through ideas in public."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "heading",
              "style": "h2",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "headings",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Three threads"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "threads",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "threadss",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Leadership, technology, and life. Some posts will be about the work of helping teams do good work. Others will follow a technical experiment or a lesson from my homelab. Occasionally, I’ll write about something outside either category."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "project",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "projects",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "The projects here will be grounded in work I’ve actually done. I’m beginning with a TrueNAS and HexOS homelab case study, where even a small change can teach you something about diagnosis, verification, and recovery."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "end",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "ends",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "This is a beginning, rather than a complete archive. I’m looking forward to seeing what grows here."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
